Jonathan: “Wow - planet Elsewhere just got an upgrade! Purple, with teal fungi growing out of this "jungle". The sky has a moon with an umbrella effect on it, almost if is dissolving, but not leaving at the same time. It is over a second smaller moon, that is mainly purple, seen through the purple world's sky. Clouds, and floating islands, and two more moons in the distance, orbiting the main Moon Spectacle. I cannot describe the umbrella moon; but the effect is something Jonathan has never seen.
Oh wow. Elsewhere has stopped merely being somewhere else and has become a genuinely alien system.
